WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.251
Your profile now has a page of its own. It starts with your initials.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.678
Your initials sit in the header. Choose them, and Profile opens without reloading

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:13.498
the page.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.847
It shows your name, when you joined, your home church and city, your bio, your goals

00:00:20.847 --> 00:00:23.686
and what you are into, on phone and desktop.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.531
Going to lists the events you registered for, soonest first, each on its day in

00:00:30.531 --> 00:00:31.290
Toronto.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.183
A brand new profile says what belongs in each section. Not going to anything yet?

00:00:39.183 --> 00:00:41.403
Browse events is one tap away.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.653
While it loads, the page keeps its shape. If it cannot load, you can try again right

00:00:48.653 --> 00:00:49.728
where you are.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.487
Only you see this page. The server takes the member from your session, never from

00:00:58.487 --> 00:01:01.779
the address, and your home church never reaches a log.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.194
Next, slice eighteen point two: edit your profile.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:21.015
That's slice eighteen point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for health

00:01:21.015 --> 00:01:22.449
in body and spirit.
